{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The latest installment of the physics-based puzzle sensation 'Q REMASTERED,' which took off primarily among Japanese streamers, is now on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's 'Q \uff57ith VTubers'!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> This time, Q features challenging and quirky puzzles designed by over 20 VTubers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We've prepared new challenges for humanity, who have already succeeded in getting a ball out of a cup and hanging a hanger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embracing the charm of 'Q REMASTERED,' this is a challenge from VTubers who have experienced 'Q' to all of humanity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As always, the solutions are entirely free and up to you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the new Q \u2013 simple 'yet' difficult.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3502720?t=1743125370","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3502720?t=1743125370","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502720/d47dd3969b4e0451f354387623fe9edf116cee7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743125370","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502720/d47dd3969b4e0451f354387623fe9edf116cee7c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743125370","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_s